{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A romantic seaside wedding awaits!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This DLC includes elegant Wedding Attire, a breezy Summer Dress, festive Wedding Festoon, and a lovely hair dye.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Items can be purchased at Matsuri and Kagari on Castle St.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Wedding Festoon for women changes your hairstyle to a special bridal look while equipped?perfect for your big day in the kingdom!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This DLC includes the following items:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u30fbOutfits</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Available at Matsuri Apparel on Castle St.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Seaside Wedding Attire, Sunset Wedding Attire, Night Sea Wedding Attire, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sea Summer Dress, Sea Outing Clothes, Sunset Summer Dress, Evening Outing Clothes, Night Sea Summer Dress, Night Sea Outing Clothes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u30fbEquipment</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Available at Kagari Accouterments on Castle St.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wedding Festoon: Red, Wedding Festoon: Blue, Wedding Festoon: Violet</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u30fbDyes</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Available at Kagari Accouterments on Castle St.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">White Sand Hair Dye</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u203b This content can only be purchased once per account.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u203b If you uninstall the DLC after saving, that save data will no longer be loadable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u203b The base game (sold separately) is required to use this content.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Please ensure your game is updated to the latest version if necessary.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/ap